{"seq":13,"slug":"graph-theory","title":"图论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory","rating":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.27,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"图论-简介\">图论 简介</h1><p>图论研究由顶点和边构成的离散结构。自 1736 年欧拉解决柯尼斯堡七桥问题以来，它已成为连接纯粹数学与计算机科学、网络科学、运筹学的核心语言。本 hub 的定位是<strong>作为数学分支的图论</strong>：以定义、定理、证明为主线，配合经典算法的正确性论证与复杂度分析，建立从&quot;图是什么&quot;到&quot;图能证明什么、能高效计算什么&quot;的完整心智模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的边界-它讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 的边界：它讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦图论的<strong>数学骨架</strong>——结构性质（连通性、平面性、着色）、组合定理（握手、Turán、Hall、Tutte、Menger）、算法及其正确性证明（最短路径、MST、网络流、匹配）。它<strong>不</strong>深入图的工程实现细节、机器学习建模或数据分析流程——这些由下列兄弟 hub 承担。选错门会事倍功半，先看清分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想要的</th>\n<th>去这里</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图论的定理与证明（本 hub）</td>\n<td>本 hub</td>\n<td>数学严谨性优先，含完整证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离散数学语境下的图（更基础）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/advanced-graph-theory/graph-fundamentals\">离散数学 · 图论基础</a></td>\n<td>作为离散数学一章，篇幅更短、与逻辑/代数并列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图的数据结构与代码实现</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/data-structures/graphs/graph-basics\">数据结构 · 图</a></td>\n<td>邻接表/矩阵的编码、内存布局、API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞赛/工程视角的图算法</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/algorithms/network-flow/\">算法 · 网络流</a></td>\n<td>重实现、模板、复杂度调优，证明从简</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图的持久化存储与查询</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations/graph-data-model\">图数据库</a></td>\n<td>Cypher/Gremlin、存储引擎、遍历优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在图上做机器学习</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/graph-representation\">图神经网络</a></td>\n<td>消息传递、GCN/GAT、训练与可扩展性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实网络的统计分析</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../data-science/network-graph-analysis/foundations/graph-basics\">网络与图分析</a></td>\n<td>中心性、社区检测、随机图模型、可视化工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 教你证明&quot;为什么&quot;，工程/AI/数据 hub 教你&quot;怎么做&quot;。</strong> 它们引用本 hub 的定理作为地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必需</strong>：集合与映射的基本记号、数学归纳法、简单的反证法（本 hub 大量证明依赖归纳与反证）。可参考 <a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/sets-and-logic/relations-functions\">离散数学 · 关系与函数</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章及之后建议</strong>：基本的算法复杂度记号（大 O）与数据结构（队列、栈、优先队列、并查集）的概念。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶章节有帮助</strong>：<a href=\"../linear-algebra/vectors-and-matrices/vector-spaces\">线性代数 · 向量空间</a>——邻接矩阵的谱、关联矩阵与拉普拉斯矩阵在第一、四章会用到；<a href=\"../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/duality-theory\">优化理论 · 对偶</a>——理解最大流最小割的对偶本质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 图的基础</strong>：形式化定义、存储表示、度数与握手定理、路径与连通性（割点/桥/SCC/连通度）。建立术语与第一批全局定理。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 图的算法</strong>：BFS/DFS 遍历、最短路径（Dijkstra/Bellman-Ford/Floyd-Warshall/Johnson）、最小生成树（Kruskal/Prim）与拓扑排序，每个算法配正确性证明与复杂度。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 特殊图与性质</strong>：二部图与平面图（欧拉公式、Kuratowski 定理）、图着色（四色/五色定理、Vizing 定理）、欧拉与哈密顿回路（含 TSP）。展现结构约束如何决定可解性。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 网络流与高级应用</strong>：最大流最小割、匹配理论（Hall/Tutte/Gale-Shapley）、图论在编译器/数据库/机器学习/社交网络中的应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>按人群分流</strong>（章节内仍建议顺序阅读）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数学/理论学习者</strong>：第一章 → 第二章 → 第三章 → 第四章，逐篇跟证明走，重点体会切割性质、对偶、极值论证等反复出现的证明模式。</li>\n<li><strong>算法/竞赛备战者</strong>：第一章（连通性）→ 第二章（最短路径、MST、拓扑排序）→ 第四章第一、二节（网络流、匹配）。第三章可按题型选读（着色、欧拉/哈密顿）。证明可略读，但务必掌握复杂度表与算法选择策略。</li>\n<li><strong>AI/数据从业者</strong>：第一章（度数分布、连通性）→ 第四章第三节（图论在 CS 中的应用）作为索引，再按需跳转到 <a href=\"../../ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/foundations/graph-representation\">图神经网络</a> 与 <a href=\"../../data-science/network-graph-analysis/foundations/graph-basics\">网络与图分析</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>硬依赖提示</strong>：网络流（第四章）建议在掌握第二章最短路径的&quot;松弛/残余&quot;思想后学习；匹配理论建立在网络流之上；第三章相对独立，可较早插入。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"图的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-definitions-representations","title":"图的定义与表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/graph-definitions-representations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"degree-handshaking-theorem","title":"度数与握手定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/degree-handshaking-theorem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"paths-connectivity","title":"路径、连通性与图的结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/paths-connectivity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"图的算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bfs-dfs-traversal","title":"图的遍历：BFS 与 DFS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/algorithms/bfs-dfs-traversal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shortest-path-algorithms","title":"最短路径算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/algorithms/shortest-path-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mst-topological-sort","title":"最小生成树与拓扑排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/algorithms/mst-topological-sort"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"special-graphs","title":"特殊图与性质","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bipartite-planar-graphs","title":"二部图与平面图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs/bipartite-planar-graphs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-coloring","title":"图着色理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs/graph-coloring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eulerian-hamiltonian","title":"欧拉回路与哈密顿回路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/special-graphs/eulerian-hamiltonian"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"network-flow-applications","title":"网络流与高级应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/network-flow-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"max-flow-min-cut","title":"最大流与最小割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/network-flow-applications/max-flow-min-cut"},{"seq":2,"slug":"matching-theory","title":"匹配理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/network-flow-applications/matching-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-applications-cs","title":"图论在计算机科学中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/network-flow-applications/graph-applications-cs"}]}]}